# Emit reads credentials from the process environment or from the local credential
# file (<data dir>/credentials.json, mode 0600). Nothing here is required to boot.
# Prefer the app UI ("设置 → 模型 Provider" / first-run setup), which configures every
# native Pi provider and stores its credential in that file; environment variables
# remain an equivalent ambient fallback when no credential is saved for a provider.
#
# Built-in providers resolve their own environment variables, for example:
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
# TYPESAFE_API_KEY=            # Jev classifier
#
# Emit-specific configuration:
# EMIT_PORT=8787
# EMIT_HOST=127.0.0.1
# EMIT_DATA_DIR=./data
